        "slc_a64b9da59b8adfba82ba5ed7860820789bdf25d0f5cdd67d07f970e86d17f7f3"
      ],
      "text": "Every runtime implements exactly two shell functions, runtime_start() for one-time setup and runtime_inject() for each incoming message, so a new runtime is a single bridge file."
    },
